          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What sweetener does Be Well by Kelly use?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Organic monk fruit, and nothing else, in Vanilla, Chocolate, Chai, Pumpkin Spice and Chocolate Mint, per the brand. There is no stevia, sucralose or sugar alcohol. Unflavored has no sweetener at all. If the flavored versions taste too sweet, the brand suggests mixing them with Unflavored, which also stretches a bag further."
