            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Drinking Chocolate every day without a second thought</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Cocoa is the main source of lead in protein powders, and we found no published heavy metal results for Be Well. Chocolate is fine as one option, but rotating with Vanilla or Unflavored is a sensible hedge for daily drinkers until the brand publishes test results.
